		{"id":"225fa58f2c77dabe","type":"text","text":"Options\n\n1. User rules\n2. Sample fil","x":-398,"y":1028,"width":558,"height":312},
		{"id":"dd24fb4d5c4a91fd","type":"text","text":"**Customer Table** \n\nCust Id is unique - Order Id and Product Id are also one... this sets up a grain...\n\nCust Id | Order Id | Product Id \n\n**Linkage Table ( One to Many)**\n\nCust Id | Name | Age\n\nCust Id | Order Id | Product Id | Sales_Amount\n\nAlthough Model is One to Many, but real data is one to One\n\n\n**Metric**\n\n**Fact_Sales**\n\nOne to One\nOne to Many\nMany to Many\n\n| Cust Id | Product Id | Order Id | Sales Amount |\n| ------- | ---------- | -------- | ------------ |\n| 1       | 1          | 1        | 10           |\n| 1       | 1          | 2        | 20           |\n| 1       | 3          | 3        | 10           |\n\n\nCust ID |Product Id | Order Id | Sales_Amount\n","x":229,"y":1028,"width":731,"height":852},
