		{"id":"95dd4e2ae3cdc4cb","type":"text","text":"**Starting Point**\n\n\n**Data Quality Rules**\n- Tech Rules\n\t- Source\n\t\t- Inferred\n- Business Rules\n\t- Source\n\t\t- \n","x":-583,"y":3239,"width":583,"height":581},
		{"id":"4d243ff9fb3d3037","type":"text","text":"- User Adding source\n\t- User selecting Files\n\t\t- Add Data Context\n\t\t\t- File Upload + Text - ? ( RAG, Context Stuffing)\n\t\t\t\t- Journey\n\t\t\t\t\t- Save Context\n\t\t\t\t\t\t- Read all Chunks\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t- Infer the DQ Context\n\n\n\n- Context stuffing\n- RAG \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t","x":-1057,"y":4036,"width":657,"height":504},
		{"id":"ed359f12a1e40f44","type":"text","text":"**Capture Validation Rules Context**\n\nPrompt user to share the Valdiation rules as context( Either via File or Text) - This shoudl be set at a Global Level\n\n- For Venna","x":-280,"y":-377,"width":320,"height":297},
		{"id":"9106968ea785279a","type":"text","text":"**Meta Inference**\n\n- CMO - \n\t- At Schema Level\n- FMO \n\t- Schema Inference\n\t-","x":155,"y":-288,"width":285,"height":388},
		{"id":"1b803bf3fff37b95","type":"text","text":"Data Inference\n\n Data quality Inference\n\t\t- **Process** - \n\t\t\t- Sample data - LLM Infere\n\t\t- Present it on UI ( Data Inference )\n\t\t\t- Data quality rule at column level\n\t\t\t- Results from LLM inference\n\t\t\t\t- Good, Bad, \n\t\t\t\t- Score?","x":620,"y":-135,"width":420,"height":355,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"aa2cab1afff30456","type":"text","text":"**Data Inference**\n\n Data quality Inference\n\t\t- **Process** - \n\t\t\t- Sample data - LLM Infere\n\t\t- Present it on UI ( Data Inference )\n\t\t\t- Data quality rule at column level\n\t\t\t- Results from LLM inference\n\t\t\t\t- Good, Bad, \n\t\t\t\t- Score?","x":620,"y":260,"width":420,"height":355,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"b59023abb6a2b202","type":"text","text":"**Conversation**\n\n1. User adds a file or text\n\t1. User gets to some global level recommendation\n\t\t1. for ex - you are saying 2 columns, 3 rules\n\t\t\t1. But llm propose, there could be much more\n\t\t\t2. We are also in the process inferening your metadata, we can propose at. your column level\n2. User Journey\n\t1. user gives the valdiation rules\n\t2. Assistant propose few global FP&A rules\n\t\t1. or you can trigger the inference \n\t3. User confirms on the inferenece\n\t4. Assitant checks the inference sate and says, it is in progress and might take a while","x":-384,"y":300,"width":460,"height":560},
		{"id":"40cd377b1c63683a","type":"text","text":"**Load is in progress**\n\n\n1. 5 minutes of Loading\n2. 10 Minutes of Inference\n3. Data Infernce\n4. ","x":120,"y":300,"width":392,"height":560},
		{"id":"99c780f03a665fb3","type":"text","text":"**Click on Data Context**","x":-384,"y":0,"width":310,"height":140},
		{"id":"17f96f75f54b6822","type":"text","text":"**Onboarding Journey**\n\nAdd Data Context ( Full File is being uploaded / Onboarding Journey)","x":-634,"y":-300,"width":250,"height":220},
		{"id":"cb466316d04516fd","type":"text","text":"Total Record count query - Total Records\n- All Good\n\t- SELECT COUNT(1) AS total_records FROM bronze_catalog.ERP_Canada.erp_chart_of_accounts_ca\n\nCount query  for failed Records  - BE Query\n- Problem\n\t- SELECT Account_Code, COUNT(*) AS code_count FROM bronze_catalog.ERP_Canada.erp_chart_of_accounts_ca GROUP BY Account_Code HAVING COUNT(*) > 1\n\nQuery for actual Failed records - result_SQl\n\t- This and above can be merged\n\nAccount codes in the Chart of Accounts should be unique\n\n- >0 \n\n1. Account 1 - 3\n2. Account 2 - 2\n\n","x":-2755,"y":5320,"width":686,"height":580},
		{"id":"d8821efb1b307bfa","type":"text","text":"Stage 1 - LLM creates the DQ SQL - Sanket and Team\n- Prone to Issue\n\t- Continous fine tuning\nStage 2 - Generated DQ SQL is valdiated by Agent - this is purushottam team\n\t- SQL Syntax check\n\t- 20 Iterations, and corrects only the Syntax and NOT query.\nStage 3 - Purushottam and team adds DQ score to the Mongo\nStage 4 - DQ scores reflect on UI\n\n\n\nUSING VANA AI","x":-2755,"y":5974,"width":635,"height":306},
		{"id":"62d2edfea77fb432","type":"text","text":"SELECT count(1) as invalid_records FROM bronze_catalog.financial_data_test_1.raw_d_test_001_f_financial_sample_data_xlsx_income_statement i LEFT JOIN bronze_catalog.financial_data_test_1.raw_d_test_001_f_financial_sample_data_xlsx_budget_vs_actual b ON ABS(i.variance_percent - b.variance_percent) > 10 LEFT JOIN bronze_catalog.financial_data_test_1.raw_d_test_001_f_financial_sample_data_xlsx_cash_flow_statement c ON ABS(i.variance_percent - c.variance_percent) > 10 WHERE i.variance_percent IS NOT NULL OR b.variance_percent IS NOT NULL OR c.variance_percent IS NOT NULL;\n\n\n\n\n\n","x":-2020,"y":5320,"width":810,"height":580},
