		{"id":"e78cafc88b1eb710","type":"text","text":"Stage 1 - Accept the information\nStage 2 - You chunk them\nStage 3 - you dump them into Blob\nStage 4 - you dump them into RAG\nStage 5 - you read the RAG and Topic Label them\n\n\nStage 5.1 - Central Topic Labelling engine - As API\n- File - < 5 MB and File - > 5MB\n\nStage 6 - an event is dumped to orchestrator\nStage 7 - This touches the meta intellignece worker\nStage 8 - Topics are then linked to right entities\n\n\nStage 9 - All above has to be aligned with Conversation Framework\n- Prompts are the problem....\n\n\nF1 - Add Data Context\nF2 - Add File \nF3 - Add Source ","x":-2969,"y":6625,"width":569,"height":515},
