		{"id":"54e0eaa380967f3a","x":1638,"y":-140,"width":762,"height":578,"color":"5","type":"text","text":"Meta Inference (Builds Table and column context)\n- Industry Type\n- Business context\n\n- Batch \n\t- Table Level\n\t\t- Description\n\t\t- Context\n\t\t\t- Chart Of Accounts\n\t\t\t\t- Possible linkages/Relationship\n\t\t\t\t\t- 2 sample rows\n\t- Column \n\t\t- Description\n\t\t\t-  Relationship Context\n\t\t\t\t- All related columns/Context ideally should be related with each other.\n\t\t\t\t\t- 2 sample rows\n\nEmbeddings\n\t- Descrptions\n\t- Columns\n"},
		{"id":"143cc85cafe7c39c","x":2520,"y":710,"width":360,"height":370,"type":"text","text":"**Prompt**\n\n1. WIth all the context avaible\n\t1. Please infer foreign keys\n\t2. "},
